Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["EvaluateCandidate", "ObjectName",
 CellID->801925034,ExpressionUUID->"708cc08e-cc9f-2c48-a563-61a9f96cb37c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"dd60a0fe-6261-fe43-a620-f4ebc5fe66f9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["EvaluateCandidate",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/EvaluateCandidate"]\
, 
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"candidate", ",", " ", "config"}], "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"b9ae1b99-ae38-8c4a-b4e6-85dc08f30220"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "evolves the rule and initial state of the candidate association ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["candidate", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c88a1c91-e219-3b40-aea8-3c50fd28a720"],
 " under the normalized configuration ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["config", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a117fe09-67d3-0640-ac94-7e179992a8c7"],
 ", computes its fitness metrics and gives the completed candidate record."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->214356218,ExpressionUUID->"d932f390-95ae-2a42-bec5-3895b7418520"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["candidate",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " needs the keys \"CandidateID\", \"Rule\" and \"InitialState\"; ",
 StyleBox["config",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " is a result of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "ValidateEvolutionConfiguration", 
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
ValidateEvolutionConfiguration", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/SamuelFrerichs/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/ValidateEvolutionConfiguration.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4aa8ccb1-df4e-5c42-9a8a-598432be0bb2"],
 ". The record gains \"Status\", \"Fitness\", \"Runtime\", \"Generations\", \
\"States\", \"FinalStates\" (verified terminal states only), \"StatesGraph\", \
\"TransitionCount\", \"HaltedWithinCapQ\", \"LimitsReached\", \
\"LongestDerivation\", \"CycleWitness\", \"TransitionMultiplicities\", \
\"EventCount\", \"EvolutionKey\", \"EvaluationID\" and \"ValidQ\"."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->988718094,ExpressionUUID->"3775fd4e-6c07-4c48-aa14-53c9c5cb7e7a"],

Cell["\<\
The EvolutionKey identifies the behavior: rule, initial state, limits, \
universe, symmetry groups, canonical-form backend, rewrite semantics, event \
recording and the evaluator, paclet, Hypergraph and Wolfram versions. The \
EvaluationID adds the effective metric specifications and artifact \
parameters. Evolutions and fitness values are cached under these keys, so a \
candidate is evolved once per kernel session.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->972288992,ExpressionUUID->"c0e16d0e-95f7-3242-b715-08645741b986"],

Cell["\<\
Artifacts that metrics need (\"EvolutionGraph\", \"EventEvolution\", \
\"CausalGraph\", \"UpdateOrderRuns\", \"EventRecords\", \"BranchialGraphs\") \
are built on demand.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->466109665,ExpressionUUID->"3f245a9c-592d-034e-9a5d-728897ee8a0c"],

Cell["\<\
The status is \"Halted\" when the exploration is exhaustive and found no \
cycle: it is verified to halt under this finite reachable exploration. \
\"CycleDetected\" means the explored states graph contains a cycle, so an \
infinite derivation exists; the result then carries a \"CycleWitness\". \
\"GenerationCap\", \"EventCap\", \"StateCap\" and \"TimedOut\" mean the \
exploration was not resolved within the stated limits, and \"Invalid\" means \
a rewrite application failed. A capped exploration never reports its \
unexplored frontier as terminal.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->960582975,ExpressionUUID->"b23fe78a-95b4-4941-b9e9-df21e9d07b50"]
}, Open  ]],

